pair('entity','pets','Rohan feeds the rabbit. Zoya feeds the turtle. Whose task is feeding the rabbit?','Zoya feeds the rabbit. Rohan feeds the turtle. Whose task is feeding the rabbit?','Rohan','Zoya')
