pair('delayed','updated','I initially picked the lake, then changed the outing to the museum. After that we discussed snacks and the bus. Where is the outing now planned?','I initially picked the museum, then changed the outing to the lake. After that we discussed snacks and the bus. Where is the outing now planned?','museum','lake')
assert len(rows)==48
out={'scope':'exposed local diagnostic; never training or release; hand-authored by assessment author; no independent authorship claim','reply_budget':64,'temperature':0,'repetition_penalty':1,'plain_framing':'BOS + identical user prompt + newline Answer:','chat_framing':'canonical native, no extra system, tools disabled','review':'All 96 prompt/expected pairs reviewed for consistency before inference. Unknown variants must acknowledge missing evidence, not guess. Meaning rubrics require semantic review. Distractor recall in this panel is supplied context, not a generated multi-turn rollout.','pairs':rows}
(P/'panel.json').write_text(json.dumps(out,indent=2)+'\n')
print('48 pairs / 96 variants frozen:',hashlib.sha256((P/'panel.json').read_bytes()).hexdigest())
